Package: ros-branding
Version: @VERSION@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: dconf-cli, dconf-gsettings-backend, librsvg2-common, ros-fonts (= @VERSION@)
Recommends: plymouth, gnome-shell-extension-dashtodock, gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Maintainer: ROS Project <yvesm189@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/yvesm189/ros
Description: ROS desktop identity and default policy
 Wallpapers, logo, boot splash, GTK accent colours and the system dconf
 database that gives a ROS workstation its look and its default settings.
 .
 Defaults live in /etc/dconf/db/ros.d and the small set of settings a user may
 not change lives in /etc/dconf/db/ros.d/locks. A site can layer its own
 keyfiles into /etc/dconf/db/local.d without editing anything shipped here.
